gahJ(){return"It adds up what you record \u2014expenses, plantings, sales and your workers' daily pay\u2014 and shows you the month, the year, the cash box, the cost per kilo and the kilos per hectare or per plant. It warns you when something is off and lets you export reports to PDF or Excel."},
gahI(){return"Your data is yours"},
